{"id":"c5f1dd9ec1ee1f87","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-turing-upper-cone-null.md","title":"Turing上锥的正测度刻画","display":"thm-turing-upper-cone-null — Turing上锥的正测度刻画","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-turing-upper-cone-null","aliases":["43-thm-turing-upper-cone-null"],"display":"thm-turing-upper-cone-null — Turing上锥的正测度刻画","depends_on":["[[43-df-turing-red]]","[[43-df-computable]]","[[43-df-cylinder]]","[[43-df-turing-join]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_location":"Corollary 11.7.2 (Sacks); Theorem 11.7.6 (Stillwell)","source_printed_pages":"266–267","source_pdf_pages":"286–287","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16-round3"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-turing-upper-cone-null"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-turing-upper-cone-null</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-turing-upper-cone-null — Turing上锥的正测度刻画"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"be1278f108eb178d\" href=\"?note=be1278f108eb178d\" title=\"43-df-turing-join\">43-df-turing-join</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Corollary 11.7.2 (Sacks); Theorem 11.7.6 (Stillwell)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"266–267"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"286–287"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-round3"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,D\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A,D\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_T\">\\(\\le_T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\oplus\">\\(\\oplus\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"be1278f108eb178d\" href=\"?note=be1278f108eb178d\" title=\"43-df-turing-join\">43-df-turing-join</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Computable}\">\\(\\operatorname{Computable}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_D\">\\(\\chi_D\\)</span> 是D的特征函数；所有所测上锥均为Borel集。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mu(\\{X\\in2^\\omega:D\\le_TX\\})&gt;0\\iff\\operatorname{Computable}(\\chi_D).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mu(\\{X\\in2^\\omega:D\\le_TX\\})&gt;0\\iff\\operatorname{Computable}(\\chi_D).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mu(\\{X\\in2^\\omega:D\\le_TA\\oplus X\\})&gt;0\\iff D\\le_TA.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mu(\\{X\\in2^\\omega:D\\le_TA\\oplus X\\})&gt;0\\iff D\\le_TA.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一式是Sacks上锥零测度定理，第二式是固定oracle A后的相对多数票版本。草稿Theorem11.7.6末句把结论误印成C≤_T A，其中C是测度量词下的变量；正文证明实际计算的是D，本原子据证明改成D≤_T A。两式的反向均有测度1。未独立重证完整相对多数票论证。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所供2007-07-28草稿，Corollary 11.7.2 (Sacks); Theorem 11.7.6 (Stillwell)；印刷页266–267，PDF页286–287。本轮逐项核对来源陈述；未将来源完整证明标记为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-cylinder]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-join","status":"resolved","id":"be1278f108eb178d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-join]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerp